The investigation into Trogwen has hit paydirt.  The outcome of the Carletzky trial is no longer in question; now the issue is the price of keeping this under wraps.


- @ozzy_blackmail: Trogwen comes to an agreement.
- @ozzy_publicity: Ozzy goes public and builds his brand

@ozzy_blackmail
title: Trogwen comes to an agreement

We come to an agreement with Trogwen where we forsake the blackmail material in exchange for her turning over a dossier of blackmail material she had on others.

You've gotta spend blackmail to make blackmail?

@ozzy_publicity
title: Ozzy goes public and builds his brand

Trogwen's loss is Ozzy's gain.  We now have a friendly journalist with a much higher profile.